#! saves cave_return
# The return from the cave stage: the "cave_return" fixture is the cave stage 62's turn-1
# autosave as cave.s2 writes it (compared there against the original's), with five of the
# six 魔頭 dead (DEAD set, DEPLOYED cleared, as a code-0x13 death leaves them) and the last
# at 1 HP (they stand on full-heal tiles and shrug off most attacks). 自動作戰 wins (inputs
# recorded by s2auto --oracle-check --record-only), the victory dialogue and rewards follow,
# then the party is back between stages at the town, next stage 60. The inn's world map
# shows where.
